---
interface Props { id?: string; }
const { id = "family-membership" } = Astro.props;
const familyProducts = [
  { name: "Gloss", mark: "g.", title: "For the words in their world", description: "A picture dictionary and personal vocabulary practice, for young readers and grown-ups learning another language." },
  { name: "Nesta", mark: "n.", title: "For the people in their world", description: "A household-first messenger, being built around family connections and parent-approved contacts for children." },
];
---
<section class="gc-shell family-membership" aria-labelledby={`${id}-title`}>
  <div class="membership-heading">
    <div><p class="gc-eyebrow">One household. More possibilities.</p><h2 id={`${id}-title`}>Built with family at heart.<br /><span>From the very beginning.</span></h2></div>
    <p class="gc-muted"><strong class="membership-plan">One subscription. A growing family of apps.</strong> The plan includes Gloss, Nesta and the TinyKite family products we launch in the future. Access stays free while we’re in beta.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="membership-products">
    {familyProducts.map(product => <article class="gc-panel membership-product"><div class="product-wordmark"><span aria-hidden="true">{product.mark}</span><h3>{product.name}</h3></div><h4>{product.title}</h4><p class="gc-muted">{product.description}</p></article>)}
  </div>

  <div class="household-explainer">
    <div class="household-story"><p class="gc-eyebrow">A closer look at Nesta</p><h3>Your household,<br />connected to theirs.</h3><p class="gc-muted">Nesta is built for your family, your friends and the parents of your child’s friends. Each family has its own household.</p><p class="gc-muted">The family model puts adults on both sides in charge of approving cross-household contacts. Each approval connects specific people; the whole household doesn’t become an open contact list.</p></div>
    <figure class="nesta-capture"><img src="/gloss/screenshots/walkthrough/nesta-chat.png" width="1320" height="2868" loading="lazy" alt="Actual Nesta household chat with fictional adults sharing grocery and weekend lunch messages, reactions, replies and a voice note." /><figcaption>Actual Nesta screen with demonstration contacts.<br />Shown in the app’s light appearance.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>

  <p class="membership-note gc-muted">Backing helps build the picture dictionary; family membership rewards include this wider family of products. Rewards and future subscription benefits are proposals until the campaign opens; expressing interest today doesn’t start a subscription or charge you.</p>
</section>
<style>
  .family-membership { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .membership-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(0,.8fr); align-items: end; gap: 2rem; }
  .membership-heading h2 { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: clamp(2rem,4vw,3.3rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .membership-heading h2 span { color: var(--gc-accent); }
  .membership-heading > p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .membership-plan { display: block; color: var(--gc-ink); margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .membership-products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .product-wordmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .product-wordmark > span { width: 3rem; height: 3rem; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; border-radius: .85rem; background: color-mix(in srgb,var(--gc-accent) 12%,var(--gc-paper)); color: var(--gc-accent); }
  .product-wordmark h3 { font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .membership-product h4 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .membership-product > p { font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: .7rem; }
  .household-explainer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem); margin-top: 3rem; }
  .household-story h3 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.5rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.025em; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .household-story > p:not(:first-child) { line-height: 1.8; font-size: .9rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .nesta-capture { min-width: 0; max-width: 280px; margin: 0; justify-self: center; }
  .nesta-capture img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain; border: 1px solid var(--gc-border); border-radius: 1.2rem; }
  .nesta-capture figcaption { color: var(--gc-muted); text-align: center; font-size: .7rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: .8rem; }
  .membership-note { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--gc-border); font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 58rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .membership-heading,.membership-products,.household-explainer { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); } .membership-heading { gap: 1.2rem; } }
</style>
